      "statement": "The system shall let invoicing and shipping proceed independently of each other once an order has been filled, so that raising an invoice does not require the order to have been shipped, setting the order to shipped does not require an invoice to have been raised, and the two may occur in either order or at the same time."
    },
    "REQ-F-32": {
      "statement": "The system shall allow a customer to submit a payment against an invoice whose status is issued, with a date, an amount and a payment method, and shall record the payment with the status pending."
    },
    "REQ-F-33": {
      "statement": "The system shall reject a payment submitted against an invoice whose status is paid."
    },
    "REQ-F-34": {
      "statement": "The system shall allow a further payment to be submitted against an invoice whose earlier payment has the status failed, shall record it as a separate payment with the status pending, and shall keep the failed payment at the status failed."
